    452  0430							; BuildStatus: rebuild the parts of the status line that changed (W_dirty).
    453  0430							; Cells (narrow 3x5 font, two characters per 8-pixel cell): 0-2 the score's
    454  0430							; last five digits (cell 2 holds one), 3 "W" + the wave's tens, 4 its ones;
    455  0430							; the sixth cell's bytes hold PF1: the batteries' two digits, in green.
    456  0430				   BuildStatus		; (one part per frame, to keep VBLANK short)
