    965  2713							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
    966  2713							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
    967  2713							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
    968  2713							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
    969  2713							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
    970  2713							; one bite. A jack-in-the-box springs on whatever reaches it; reaching the
    971  2713							; toy box is a breach.
