   1653  2ba4							; Sound: channel 0 plays the player's actions and jingles, channel 1 combat.
   1654  2ba4							; A sound is a list of steps (ticks of two frames, AUDC*16+AUDV, AUDF) ending
   1655  2ba4							; in a zero; a new sound replaces the one playing on its channel unless that
   1656  2ba4							; one matters more (SndPri).
